646	#### addcustom_operation.cpp
647	
648	File path: `src/ops/ops_infer/addcustom/addcustom_operation.cpp`
649	Function: The file for creating and managing operator functions
650	
651	```c++
652	#include "addcustom_operation.h"
653	
654	#include "addcustom_ops_runner.h"
655	#include "atb/operation/atb_operation_ir_cfg.h"
656	#include "atb/operation/op_param_funcs.h"
